OL,5,G2000 Dream Car Fixers
OL,6,     FRover: Sheldon and Peter are
OL,7,     Ftasked with the ultimate challenge
OL,8,     F- a classic car that's reliable
OL,9,     Fenough for everyday use. They take
OL,10,     Fon the first ever European Car of
OL,11,     Fthe Year, a Rover P6.
OL,12,G2100 Bangers & Cash: Restoring Classics
OL,13,     FAllegro/Corsa: The team acquire an
OL,14,     F80s Austin Allegro and soon find
OL,15,     Fout how it got the nickname 'all
OL,16,     Faggro'. Next, they take on a DIY
OL,17,     Fproject to save some cash with a
OL,18,     F90s Vauxhall Corsa.
